BURST BURST BEYBLEDE! )

53
00:02:55,758 --> 00:02:57,760
BURST BURST 3, 2, 1, АТЫЛЫҢЫЗ! )

54
00:02:57,760 --> 00:02:59,762
BURST BURST 3, 2, 1, АТЫЛЫҢЫЗ! )

55
00:02:57,760 --> 00:02:59,762
